WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:06.150
The Global Occult Coalition, better known
as the GOC, are a group of bloodthirsty, gun-toting

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:09.700
cowboys who shoot first and ask questions
later.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:13.679
Whether it’s a helpful sentient chair or
a little girl whose only anomalous quality

00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:19.960
is manifesting flowers and ice cream, the
GOC have only one response: Destroy.

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:25.670
Burn it, crush it, shoot it in the face with
extreme prejudice and be home in time for

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:26.670
dinner.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:31.220
Or at least, that’s what plenty of SCP Foundation
Devotees would have you believe.

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:35.989
But if we only judged an organization by the
words of its greatest opponents, we’d be

00:00:35.989 --> 00:00:38.800
dealing with an extremely one-sided picture.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:43.780
Are they gung ho morons who regularly blunder
into complex situations, and make everything

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:46.670
worse with either plain ignorance or outright
malice?

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:51.940
Or are they humanity’s true defenders, working
on behalf of the world’s democratically

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:56.120
elected leaders rather than the unaccountable
mystery of The Foundation?

00:00:56.120 --> 00:01:01.039
As with most things in life, the answer is
often found somewhere in the middle.

00:01:01.039 --> 00:01:05.519
That’s why today, we’re going to take
a closer look at the United Nations’ answer

00:01:05.519 --> 00:01:08.369
to the anomalous threats that inhabit our
world.

00:01:08.369 --> 00:01:09.369
Who are they?

00:01:09.369 --> 00:01:10.500
What do they believe?

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:14.090
And what are some of their greatest victories
and failures?

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:18.530
The inception of what we now know as the Global
Occult Coalition began during the Seventh

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:21.600
Occult War, which occurred during World War
II.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:26.620
The Nazi SS Ahnenerbe and the Thule-Gesselschaft
attempted to complete a ritual known as the

00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:31.009
Rite of Solomon, which would have given them
terrifying supernatural power.

00:01:31.009 --> 00:01:35.899
This was the first time that a number of world
governments understood the true scope of the

00:01:35.899 --> 00:01:40.659
paranormal threat out there, and after the
war concluded - with many dead - they wanted

00:01:40.659 --> 00:01:46.159
to make sure this could never happen again.Of
course, the SCP Foundation works in cooperation

00:01:46.159 --> 00:01:50.009
with all world governments, but ultimately,
they still have autonomy.

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:55.070
And no one nation could ever shoulder the
responsibility of protecting all of humanity,

00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:59.090
either, lest nationalism and self-interest
get in the way of the mission.

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:03.979
The United Nations needed their own organization,
that was completely accountable to them and

00:02:03.979 --> 00:02:08.940
them alone in order to protect themselves
from paranormal threats - or “Parathreats”.

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:12.930
And thus, the Global Occult Coalition was
born.

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:18.319
As the “coalition” part of the name suggests,
the GOC is an umbrella term for 108 different

00:02:18.319 --> 00:02:23.310
paranormal organizations - all gathered under
the shared goal of protecting humanity from

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:28.819
parathreats and fostering continued positive
relationships between paranormal groups.

00:02:28.819 --> 00:02:34.209
Its member groups include, but are in no way
limited to: The Bavarian Illuminati, The International

00:02:34.209 --> 00:02:39.940
Center for the Study of Unified Thaumatology,
The Reformed Holy Order of the Knights Templar,

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:44.720
Servants of the Silicon Nornir, The United
Church of Satan - Science Division, The World

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:48.519
Parahealth Organization, and The Universalist
Order of the Æsir.

00:02:48.519 --> 00:02:50.900
Yeah, it’s a lot to take in.

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:53.670
But don’t worry, there won’t be a quiz
later.

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:59.040
These groups and many more unite under the
Global Occult Coalition’s “Fivefold Mission.”

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:03.159
Understanding these five missions is vital
to understanding why the GOC works in the

00:03:03.159 --> 00:03:07.050
way it does, and why it differs from the Foundation.

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:12.879
Mission One: Survival - This is the primary
directive of the GOC, ensuring the survival

00:03:12.879 --> 00:03:15.720
of humanity in the face of parathreats.

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:21.750
Mission Two: Concealment - Much like the Foundation,
the GOC seeks to conceal knowledge of parathreats

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:25.580
from the public that could cause mass panic
or loss of life.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:30.420
Mission Three: Protection - In an interesting
departure from the somewhat colder Foundation

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:37.560
perspective, the GOC also prizes the safety
of individual humans, including its own personnel.

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:42.400
Mission Four: Destruction - This mission is
perhaps the biggest difference between the

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:47.270
GOC and the Foundation, and is often what
defines them in the public eye.

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:53.230
The GOC considers the very existence of parathreats
to be a danger to the survival of humanity,

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:56.510
so no risks are taken to ensure their survival.

00:03:56.510 --> 00:04:02.190
And finally, Mission Five: Education - The
GOC seeks to expand their knowledge base in

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:05.590
regards to the parathreats they face across
the globe.

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:09.159
Clearly, the Global Occult Coalition knows
where they stand.

00:04:09.159 --> 00:04:13.870
Many have positioned the GOC as villains to
the Foundation’s more level-headed approach,

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:18.160
but arguments could also be made in the GOC’s
favor when it comes to killing off rather

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:20.090
than studying anomalies.

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:23.720
The number of deaths caused in containment
breaches of parathreats that could have been

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:29.550
executed immediately after being captured
is one persuasive argument, as is the continued

00:04:29.550 --> 00:04:32.990
potential threat of parathreats currently
sitting in containment.

00:04:32.990 --> 00:04:38.270
And while the GOC has been called inhumane
for its desire to murder parathreats, ask

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:43.880
any member of D-Class Personnel whether the
SCP Foundation is a more ethical organization

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:44.880
in comparison.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:49.710
While the Foundation are generally far more
considerate with anomalies than the GOC, their

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:54.240
attitude towards their human cannon fodder
is just as cold.

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:59.280
Of course, we’re not saying either organization
is right or wrong in this instance - more

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:02.960
that it’s a nuanced issue that’s difficult
to look at in terms of morality.

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:07.770
Later, we’ll take a look at two of the most
famous case studies to see how the GOC’s

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:10.139
methodology plays out on the field.

00:05:10.139 --> 00:05:14.160
But first, let’s take a look at how the
actual organization is structured.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:16.960
At the top of the tower is the Council of
108.

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:21.330
Much like the United Nations, this Council
is made up of representatives from each of

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:24.860
the 108 member organizations of the GOC.

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:29.520
Below that is the High Command, headed by
the mysterious Under-Secretary-General D.C.

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:35.380
al Fine - believed to be a woman who is living
somewhere in Europe - as well as The Nexus.

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:40.830
The Nexus directs a network of Command Central
hubs to coordinate and support local operations.

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:47.389
Below that, the GOC is separated into three
prongs: The PHYSICS Division, the PSYCHE Division,

00:05:47.389 --> 00:05:52.930
and the PTOLEMY Division.The PHYSICS division
is the action arm of the GOC, made up of Assessment

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:54.440
Teams and Strike Teams.

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:58.819
It’s their job to investigate and capture
or neutralize parathreats.

00:05:58.819 --> 00:06:03.819
The PSYCHE Division is the diplomatic sector
of the GOC, and consists of Special Observers

00:06:03.819 --> 00:06:09.000
and Ambassadors - these personnel maintain
relationships between paranormal groups, and

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:12.880
keeps things smooth between normal humanity
and the Occult.

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:17.479
The PTOLEMY Division is known as the support
arm, and is home to the Quartermasters and

00:06:17.479 --> 00:06:19.830
the Research and Development department.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:24.509
This division helps the other two divisions
do their work - from managing logistics and

00:06:24.509 --> 00:06:30.270
resource distribution, to developing state
of the art weapons and equipment for GOC personnel.

00:06:30.270 --> 00:06:34.789
One more quick note before we move onto two
of the GOC’s greatest hits: It’s important

00:06:34.789 --> 00:06:40.199
to know that the GOC classifies anomalies
different to how the SCP Foundation does.

00:06:40.199 --> 00:06:45.440
Rather than SCPs, the GOC refers to them as
TEs, or Threat Entities.

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:50.980
While the GOC employs a frankly baffling number
of code words for various groups, ideas, or

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:55.230
concepts that we don’t have the time to
get into right now, we can tell you the main

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:56.430
types of TEs.

00:06:56.430 --> 00:07:00.229
There are KTEs - or “Known Threat Entities.”

00:07:00.229 --> 00:07:03.110
UTE - or “Unknown Threat Entities.”

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:06.169
PTEs - “Potential Threat Entities.”

00:07:06.169 --> 00:07:11.629
And LTEs - or “Liquidated Threat Entities”,
which are Threat Entities they have confirmed

00:07:11.629 --> 00:07:12.770
to be destroyed.

00:07:12.770 --> 00:07:17.050
Now, you should have a pretty good idea of
who the Global Occult Coalition is - their

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:21.819
member organizations, their mission statements,
their major ideological differences from the

00:07:21.819 --> 00:07:23.419
SCP Foundation.

00:07:23.419 --> 00:07:28.550
But it’s a common truism that actions speak
louder than words, so we need to talk about

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:32.940
two of the most infamous incidents in the
organization's history.

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:35.280
First, there’s the chair.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:43.000
Known as KTE-0937-Velveteen or "Sixth Chair"
to the Global Occult Coalition, and SCP - 1609

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.070
to the SCP Foundation.

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:49.669
This is an incident that the Foundation and
Foundation supporters love to cite when criticizing

00:07:49.669 --> 00:07:50.980
the GOC.

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:56.940
From their telling, 1609 was an innocent,
if a little spooky-looking chair with a harmless

00:07:56.940 --> 00:08:00.940
anomalous property - It teleports behind people
who want to sit down.

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:05.610
In spite of how helpful and benign this is,
the Global Occult Coalition did what they

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:10.620
always do and decided to neutralize it by
forcing it into a woodchipper.

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:15.190
However, this didn’t actually kill the chair,
it merely transformed it into a collection

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:19.130
of sentient wood chips with an understandable
chip on its shoulder.

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:24.240
Now, when angered - typically by mentions
of things related to the GOC, or by the sound

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:29.950
of motors running - these chips teleport into
people’s lungs, causing fatal organ damage.

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:35.250
Surely this shows that the GOC are a bunch
of haphazard idiots - they transformed a harmless

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:36.500
anomaly into a killer!

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:38.680
Well, it’s not that simple.

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:43.540
According to their own telling of the incident
with the Sixth Chair, it was exactly that:

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:47.470
Just the sixth in a number of other parathreats
being destroyed because of their relation

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:51.110
to a dangerous parathreat creator known as
The Carpenter.

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:56.280
All five other items were successfully incinerated
- the chair was only unsuccessfully neutralized

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:59.750
with the woodchipper due to a machine error
with the incinerator.

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:05.250
In other words, what is often painted as a
prime example of GOC brashness and incompetence

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:10.540
could just as easily have been a total accident
that occurred during an otherwise logical

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:11.540
action.

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:15.660
No different from the fatalities that often
occur during an SCP Foundation containment

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:16.660
breach.

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:24.070
But let’s look at another example: SCP - 1522,
known to the GOC as LTE-4201-Velveteen, or

00:09:24.070 --> 00:09:26.580
the "Ghost Ships.”

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:31.170
The Foundation often cites this as being another
textbook example of the GOC taking things

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:36.360
too far, and murdering a completely innocent
anomaly minding its own business.

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:40.960
This anomaly was two apparently sapient boats
in the middle of the ocean that showed compassion

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:45.270
for one another, giving them the reputation
of being literal love boats.

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:50.330
The GOC apparently objected to this union
and blew one of the boats to kingdom come,

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:53.320
leaving the other to self-terminate in grief.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:57.970
How can the GOC possibly come out as anything
but monsters in this scenario - harming two

00:09:57.970 --> 00:10:00.770
wholesome anomalies that would never hurt
a fly?

00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:02.940
Well, don’t be so sure about that.

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:07.360
From the GOC report, we can first see that
the boats were already encroaching into human

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:12.190
territory, leading to reports of “ghost
ships“ from fishermen trawling in that area.

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:17.630
And while the GOC did admittedly fire the
first shot, it cannot be denied that the surviving

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:22.480
ship’s retaliation was equally if not more
violent than the initial attack.

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:27.080
Upon attacking the first of the two ships,
the second wilfully collided with the GOC

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:31.890
vessel, manned by the Strike Team Ocean Thunder,
at hypersonic speeds.

00:10:31.890 --> 00:10:34.360
This killed the entire GOC team present.

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:38.660
While it’s easy to say that this attack
was in self-defense, it also shows that the

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:42.350
boats always had devastating combat potential
if provoked.

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:46.520
If the parathreat had performed this same
act on a larger Navy ship, or on a cruise

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:50.900
ship or any kind of commercial vessel, hundreds
of lives would be lost.

00:10:50.900 --> 00:10:53.810
Doesn’t seem so innocent now, does it?

00:10:53.810 --> 00:10:56.140
What conclusion can we draw from all this?

00:10:56.140 --> 00:11:00.730
Is the Global Occult Coalition a gaggle of
bloodthirsty idiots looking to kill off anomalies

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:02.220
for the sake of it?

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:03.220
No.

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:08.100
Are they a morally perfect organization, protecting
human survival and the quality of human life

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:10.630
from a Foundation that couldn’t care less?

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:12.750
The answer is “no” here too.

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:17.820
While the SCP Foundation and the GOC have
been known to squabble, and have caused even

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:23.610
more damage to one another in alternate realities,
they’re ultimately two sides of the same

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:24.610
coin.

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:28.620
The two have even been known to reluctantly
collaborate when necessary.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:32.740
Perhaps they don’t always see eye to eye,
especially on some of the smaller and more

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:37.830
contentious anomalies, but in a world where
cosmic nightmares are lurking just behind

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:43.930
the fabric of our reality and some are preparing
to strike, it feels comforting to have both

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.510
of them at the ready.

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:50.930
Now go check out our playlist on the epic
saga of SCP - 5000, The Suit, and a world

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:55.100
where the SCP and the GOC really come to blows.

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:59.380
And don’t forget to subscribe and tell us
in the comments which piece of SCP lore you

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:02.079
want to see next!

